{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/696d2ad0a154fa1dfbc168b106f24e69.avif?t=1763918087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras_big/696d2ad0a154fa1dfbc168b106f24e69.webp?t=1763918087 width=1560 height=191 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role<i> </i>of a dungeon manager in<i>\u00a0</i>this roguelike tower-defense meets autobattler. Build out your dungeon by night and defend against parties of adventuring &quot;heroes&quot; by day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/f1b2d093f0621782d95fc5d8fce79b25.poster.avif?t=1763918087\" width=574 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/f1b2d093f0621782d95fc5d8fce79b25.webm?t=1763918087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/f1b2d093f0621782d95fc5d8fce79b25.mp4?t=1763918087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/2170a22d494a54ee294eb0c1d49c4840.avif?t=1763918087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras_big/2170a22d494a54ee294eb0c1d49c4840.webp?t=1763918087 width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build traps, deploy minions and cast spells to repel the heroes seeking to &quot;liberate&quot; the treasures of your coffers.<br> Test your build against the might of legendary bosses.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/6092222f2d1edb2b41605d7982451384.poster.avif?t=1763918087\" width=674 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/6092222f2d1edb2b41605d7982451384.webm?t=1763918087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/6092222f2d1edb2b41605d7982451384.mp4?t=1763918087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras/94193a9f9fd709dd2a97bc6295991138.avif?t=1763918087\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303870/extras_big/94193a9f9fd709dd2a97bc6295991138.webp?t=1763918087 width=1560 height=181 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your workforce of minions and assign them to complete various tasks throughout your dungeon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine</strong> for<strong>\u00a0</strong>valuable ores to add gold to your coffers\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build </strong>and <strong>Upgrade\u00a0</strong>traps and buildings to repel heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy</strong> minions to guard against the next wave of adventurers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo